            <ArticleTitle>Construction and characterisation of a heparan sulphate heptasaccharide microarray.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1743-1746</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c6cc08204a</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A targeted heptasaccharide library was synthesised to prepare a heparan sulphate (HS) microarray. The array was probed with two glycan-binding proteins, HS 3-O-sulphotransferase 1 and antithrombin, demonstrating the binding selectivity between HS and proteins. The HS microarray technique will accelerate the understanding of the structure and function relationships of HS.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
